msgstr "디렉터리"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/DebugFilesPanel.php:130
msgid ""
"Filter with linguaforge_debug_dir to redirect debug output to a non-public "
"location."
msgstr ""
"언어포지 디버그 디렉터리로 디버그 출력을 리디렉션하려면 linguaforge_debug_dir"
"로 필터링하세요."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/DebugFilesPanel.php:134
